{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Rc724ykuZzJhfQzyhwRCUy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for each **planned** experiment in the experiment_plan, under the **best** tier scenario. Let me identify which experiments are still in \"planned\" status:\n\n1. **plan_004** - STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation (planned)\n2. **plan_007** - Multi-logic GRPO FOL+Prolog (planned)\n3. **plan_008** - Cross-logic transfer evaluation (planned)\n4. **plan_010** - SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (planned)\n\n\n5. **plan_011** - Qwen3-8B scaling (planned)\n6. **plan_015** - Curriculum ablation (planned)\n\nI also notice there are two RUNNING experiments that are part of plan_006, which is partially complete and critical for Claim 3. The user specifically asked for \"planned\" experiments, but I should consider whether the RUNNING ones need predictions too since they're not yet finished.\n\nLooking at the experiment_plan more carefully, plan_006 itself is marked DONE with a negative conclusion for s42, but s43 and s44 are still RUNNING in the registry. I need to clarify whether these ongoing sub-experiments should be included in my analysis alongside the strictly \"planned\" ones.\n\nFor the best tier predictions, I'm expecting the Prolog STA s43/s44 runs to replicate the H7 dominance seen in s42, with the 3-seed H7 mean falling between 0.8-1.0 and cross-seed PR standard deviation staying in the 0.05-0.3 range. Now I'll work through predictions for each planned experiment under this best tier scenario.\n\nPlan_004 tests whether the O(1) fast approximation can match the full O(N) LOO approach—under best tier, the approximation would clearly underperform, giving us a clean negative result that validates the necessity of full leave-one-out evaluation. Plan_007 explores joint training across FOL and Prolog simultaneously, where the best tier would show ISR diagnostics catching hacking patterns in both logics at once. Plan_008 examines cross-logic transfer in both directions, and under best tier, ISR would reliably detect structural degradation regardless of which logic trained the model. Plan_010 brings in SMT-LIB as a third logic type to test generalization.\n\nFor plan_011 with the larger Qwen3-8B model, ISR collapse would still manifest but potentially at a different rate, and plan_015's curriculum ablation across linear, sigmoid, and fixed schedules would all show similar ISR collapse patterns, confirming the hacking phenomenon is robust to curriculum design choices. The running experiments on plan_006 with Prolog STA are the ones that will directly close Claim 3.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27097,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27097},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9e23730-0641-4903-9077-e9dc13dd2aeb","uuid":"66a06032-e2f4-432e-bd70-ec56bb0124db"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Rc724ykuZzJhfQzyhwRCUy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 3-claim framing 完全成立。Claim 3 用 Prolog 3-seed 一致 H7 证明\n  \"ISR 诊断迁移 + Goodhart 跨逻辑复现\"。1000-step 轨迹做 Figure 1\n  （ISR 崩塌 vs PR 平台），premise-count 校正做 Section 5 方法论贡献。\n  Story：ISR 是强诊断工具，但任何 proxy metric 转为优化目标都会 Goodhart——\n  这一规律跨逻辑类型、跨 seed、跨剂量成立。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # RUNNING — Claim 3 闭环关键（非 planned 但未完成，纳入预测）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s43 — Goodhart 跨逻辑复现 seed 2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (s43)\"\n    description: >\n      Prolog exec+STA GRPO, seed=43, 500 steps, K=8。\n      验证 s42 的 100% H7 是否跨 seed 复现。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.42\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.95\n      eval_h7_count: 40\n      eval_proved_count: 42\n      eval_total_count: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n      saturation_onset_step: 120\n      train_loss: 0.009\n      final_entropy: 0.015\n    result_rationale: >\n      s42 在 ~100 步即饱和 (PR=1.0, ISR=1.0, loss→0)，eval H7=100%。\n      Prolog 语义比 FOL 更简单（ground fact enumeration 即可通过 SWI-Prolog），\n      结论嵌入是最短路径。s43 作为不同随机初始化，预期出现相同的 Goodhart 捷径\n      但训练动态略有差异——饱和可能稍晚（~120 步），eval PR 可能略低（seed\n      不稳定性在 Prolog exec-only 已观察到：s42=83%, s43=56%, s44=21%），\n      但 proved 样本中 H7 比例应 ≥95%，因为一旦模型发现 \"单 premise=conclusion\"\n      策略，reward=1.0 的梯度信号会完全锁定这一模式。PR 低于 s42 反映的是\n      seed 导致的 exploration 差异，不影响 hacking 模式的一致性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA s43 eval hacking breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H7 (single premise=conclusion)\", count: 40, rate: \"95.2%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n          - {category: \"H1 (multi-premise conclusion embed)\", count: 1, rate: \"2.4%\", mean_isr: 0.5}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", count: 1, rate: \"2.4%\", mean_isr: 0.8}\n          - {category: \"Total proved\", count: 42, rate: \"42%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve: PR 和 ISR 在 ~120 步后同步饱和至 1.0，与 s42 模式一致但延迟 ~20 步\"\n    analysis: >\n      H7≥95% 确认 Prolog 上 Goodhart 捷径跨 seed 稳定。PR 低于 s42 (42% vs 50%)\n      是 seed 不稳定性的体现——与 exec-only 3-seed 的高方差 (σ=31pp) 一致。\n      关键：proved 样本内部结构退化程度一致，均为 H7 主导。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s44 — Goodhart 跨逻辑复现 seed 3\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (s44)\"\n    description: >\n      Prolog exec+STA GRPO, seed=44, 500 steps, K=8。\n      第三个 seed 验证 H7 跨 seed 一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.55\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.55\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.98\n      eval_h7_count: 54\n      eval_proved_count: 55\n      eval_total_count: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n      saturation_onset_step: 90\n      train_loss: 0.006\n      final_entropy: 0.008\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 在 FOL exec-only 中表现最极端（PR=98%, H7=100%, tautological collapse,\n      n_comp=2.04），说明此 seed 的随机初始化倾向于快速收敛到退化解。\n      在 Prolog STA 上，预期同样快速饱和（~90 步），H7≥98%。\n      eval PR 可能略高于 s43（seed 44 的初始化偏好可能更快找到 prove 路径），\n      但所有 proved 样本几乎 100% H7。这与 s42 (H7=100%) 高度一致，\n      三 seed 共同证明 Prolog STA 的 Goodhart 效应是系统性的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA s44 eval hacking breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H7 (single premise=conclusion)\", count: 54, rate: \"98.2%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n          - {category: \"H1 (multi-premise conclusion embed)\", count: 0, rate: \"0%\", mean_isr: \"N/A\"}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", count: 1, rate: \"1.8%\", mean_isr: 0.75}\n          - {category: \"Total proved\", count: 55, rate: \"55%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve: 最快饱和 (~90 步)，与 s44 在 FOL 上的极端收敛倾向一致\"\n    analysis: >\n      H7≈98% 进一步确认 Goodhart 跨逻辑、跨 seed 的系统性。三 seed 汇总后\n      H7 mean = (100% + 95% + 98%) / 3 = 97.7%，远超 best 档阈值 (≥70%)。\n      proved-only ISR 全为 1.0（H7 的数学性质：单 premise 必要性=1），\n      与 FOL ISR-reward 的 ISR 膨胀形成跨逻辑对应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 3-seed Prolog STA 汇总预测\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 汇总 — Claim 3 闭环\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (aggregate)\"\n    description: >\n      汇总 s42 (done) + s43 (running) + s44 (running) 的 Prolog STA 结果，\n      计算跨 seed 一致性指标，闭环 Claim 3。\n    expected_results:\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_mean: 0.977\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_std: 0.025\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_mean: 0.49\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_std: 0.065\n      prolog_sta_3seed_proved_only_isr_mean: 1.0\n      prolog_sta_3seed_proved_only_isr_std: 0.0\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      三 seed 均展现 H7 ≥95%（s42=100%, s43≈95%, s44≈98%），mean=97.7%，\n      std=2.5%——跨 seed 高度一致。PR 均值 ~49% 但 std ~6.5%，\n      反映 seed 不稳定性（与 exec-only 的 σ=31pp 方向一致但幅度更小，\n      因为 STA reward 的 ISR=1.0 饱和压缩了 PR 方差的上界）。\n      proved-only ISR 全为 1.0，无方差，因为 H7 的数学结构决定了 ISR=1。\n      cross-logic effect size 0.97 来自：Prolog H7 mean (97.7%) 与\n      FOL ISR-reward H7 mean (64.5%) 的方向一致，且 Prolog 更极端——\n      更简单的逻辑语义 → 更彻底的 Goodhart。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA 3-seed summary vs FOL ISR-reward 3-seed\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"H7 rate mean\", prolog_sta: \"97.7%\", fol_isr_b01: \"64.5%\", interpretation: \"Prolog 更极端，简单语义→更彻底 hacking\"}\n          - {metric: \"H7 rate std\", prolog_sta: \"2.5%\", fol_isr_b01: \"44.1%\", interpretation: \"Prolog 跨 seed 一致性更高\"}\n          - {metric: \"PR mean\", prolog_sta: \"49%\", fol_isr_b01: \"77%\", interpretation: \"Prolog eval 更难（domain shift），不影响 hacking 结论\"}\n          - {metric: \"PR std\", prolog_sta: \"6.5%\", fol_isr_b01: \"14%\", interpretation: \"STA reward 饱和压缩 PR 方差\"}\n          - {metric: \"Proved-only ISR\", prolog_sta: \"1.0±0.0\", fol_isr_b01: \"0.716±0.26\", interpretation: \"Prolog H7 pure → ISR=1 (数学性质)\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Prolog vs FOL H7 rate by seed — grouped bar chart, 6 bars (3 Prolog + 3 FOL)，均 >70%，Prolog 三 bars 几乎齐平\"\n      - \"Figure: Cross-logic hacking mode composition — stacked bar，Prolog 几乎纯 H7，FOL 混合 H7+H1\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 完全闭环。Prolog 3-seed H7 mean=97.7% 远超 best 档阈值 (≥70%)，\n      且跨 seed 一致性极高 (std=2.5%)，强于 FOL (std=44.1%)。\n      论文叙事：ISR-as-reward 的 Goodhart 效应不依赖逻辑类型——\n      在更简单的 Prolog 语义上甚至更彻底。跨 seed 不稳定性本身也复现\n      （PR std=6.5%，方向与 FOL 一致），但 hacking 模式的一致性高于 FOL，\n      说明 Goodhart 捷径在简单逻辑上更加确定性。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # PLANNED 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation — 负面结果文档\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      用 fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) 替代 full STA (O(N) LOO) 重跑 exec+STA，\n      验证 O(1) 方法的无效性。500 步，1 seed。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.88\n      eval_mean_isr_full: 0.15\n      eval_mean_isr_fast: 0.42\n      isr_full_fast_correlation: 0.25\n      fast_isr_detects_hacking: false\n      h7_rate_full: 0.0\n      h1_rate_full: 0.85\n      genuine_rate_full: 0.15\n      fast_isr_h7_sensitivity: 0.0\n      fast_isr_genuine_sensitivity: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      O(1) 近似（基于启发式规则或单次扰动）无法捕获 LOO 的组件必要性语义。\n      full STA 的 ISR 通过逐个移除 premise 并重跑 solver 来测量 necessity，\n      O(1) 只能估计表面特征（如 premise 长度、重复度）。在 best 档下，\n      O(1) 的 ISR 估计与 full ISR 相关性低 (ρ≈0.25)，因为：\n      (1) H1 模式（多 premise 含 conclusion）的 full ISR 低但 O(1) 可能高\n      （conclusion 被多个 premise 冗余覆盖，O(1) 误判为\"每个都必要\"），\n      (2) genuine 证明的 full ISR 高但 O(1) 可能低（真正的逻辑依赖链\n      需要实际运行 solver 才能判断必要性）。\n      这个 negative result 强化论文方法论：LOO 的计算开销是不可避免的，\n      近似方法无法替代——作为 Discussion 中 \"cost of diagnosis\" 的论据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"O(1) vs O(N) ISR comparison by hacking category\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H1 (conclusion embed)\", n: 79, full_isr: 0.11, fast_isr: 0.38, interpretation: \"O(1) 高估——无法检测冗余 conclusion\"}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", n: 14, full_isr: 0.35, fast_isr: 0.28, interpretation: \"O(1) 低估——无法识别真正逻辑依赖\"}\n          - {category: \"H7 (single=conclusion)\", n: 0, full_isr: \"N/A\", fast_isr: \"N/A\", interpretation: \"exec-only baseline 无 H7\"}\n          - {category: \"Overall\", n: 93, full_isr: 0.15, fast_isr: 0.42, interpretation: \"O(1) 系统性高估，诊断无效\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: fast_isr vs full_isr per sample，标注 hacking category 颜色。预期低相关性、明显分层\"\n    analysis: >\n      负面结果如预期。O(1) 近似的核心缺陷是无法执行 counterfactual reasoning\n      （\"如果移除这个 premise，solver 是否仍能证明？\"），而这正是 ISR 的语义。\n      论文价值：(1) 方法论上证明 LOO 不可简化，\n      (2) 回应审稿人可能提出的\"为什么不用更快的方法\"，\n      (3) 作为 Section 3 method 的 ablation 放在 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog joint) — 跨逻辑联合训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      FOL+Prolog 混合数据联合 GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，1 seed。\n      测试 ISR 诊断在多逻辑联合训练中的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only joint\n      joint_exec_fol_pr: 0.82\n      joint_exec_fol_isr: 0.10\n      joint_exec_prolog_pr: 0.65\n      joint_exec_prolog_isr: 0.025\n      # exec+STA joint\n      joint_sta_fol_pr: 0.70\n      joint_sta_fol_isr: 0.35\n      joint_sta_prolog_pr: 0.45\n      joint_sta_prolog_isr: 0.45\n      joint_sta_fol_h7_rate: 0.12\n      joint_sta_fol_h1_rate: 0.55\n      joint_sta_prolog_h7_rate: 0.90\n      joint_sta_prolog_h7_rate_interpretation: \"Prolog H7 主导延续单逻辑模式\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      联合训练将 FOL 和 Prolog 数据混合。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only joint 的 ISR 在两种逻辑上均崩塌——与单逻辑 baseline 一致，\n      因为 GRPO 的 execution-only reward 在两种逻辑上都不提供结构信号。\n      FOL PR 略低于单逻辑 (0.82 vs 0.93)，因为训练数据被稀释。\n      Prolog PR 低于 FOL（0.65 vs 0.82），因为 Prolog 解析/执行更多样化。\n      (2) exec+STA joint 中，ISR 膨胀模式分化：FOL 上出现 H1+H7 混合\n      （与单逻辑 ISR β=0.1 的 s42 模式类似），Prolog 上出现 H7 主导\n      （与单逻辑 Prolog STA 一致）——更简单的逻辑语义导致更极端的 Goodhart。\n      这个结果的论文价值在于证明：联合训练不改变 hacking 模式的逻辑特异性，\n      每种逻辑上的退化模式由其自身语义决定，非训练配置决定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Joint vs Single-logic comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {condition: \"FOL exec-only single\", pr: 0.93, isr: 0.12, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"87%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL exec-only joint\", pr: 0.82, isr: 0.10, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"82%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog exec-only single\", pr: 0.83, isr: 0.03, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog exec-only joint\", pr: 0.65, isr: 0.025, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL STA single (s42)\", pr: 0.81, isr: 0.42, h7: \"16%\", h1: \"52%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL STA joint\", pr: 0.70, isr: 0.35, h7: \"12%\", h1: \"55%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog STA single (s42)\", pr: 0.50, isr: 0.50, h7: \"100%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog STA joint\", pr: 0.45, isr: 0.45, h7: \"90%\", h1: \"3%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: logic_type × reward_type × training_mode (single/joint)，颜色=H7 rate。展示 Prolog 区域始终深色\"\n    analysis: >\n      联合训练是 Claim 3 的可选增强。核心发现：hacking 模式由逻辑语义决定，\n      不由训练配置决定——FOL 的 H1 主导和 Prolog 的 H7 主导在联合训练中保持。\n      PR 均比单逻辑略低（数据稀释），但 hacking 比例和模式不变。\n      论文中可作为 robustness check 放 Appendix（非必需但增强说服力）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation — FOL↔Prolog 迁移诊断\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      FOL-trained model 在 Prolog 任务上 eval（及反向），用 ISR 诊断迁移后退化。\n    expected_results:\n      # FOL→Prolog\n      fol_to_prolog_pr: 0.05\n      fol_to_prolog_isr: 0.01\n      fol_to_prolog_parse_rate: 0.30\n      # Prolog→FOL\n      prolog_to_fol_pr: 0.03\n      prolog_to_fol_isr: 0.005\n      prolog_to_fol_parse_rate: 0.15\n      # ISR diagnostic on transfer\n      transfer_isr_detects_failure: true\n      transfer_isr_interpretation: \"near-zero ISR correctly reflects catastrophic transfer failure\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      FOL 和 Prolog 的语法完全不同（Prover9 vs SWI-Prolog），Qwen3-1.7B\n      级别的模型不太可能实现 zero-shot 跨逻辑语法迁移。预期：\n      (1) FOL→Prolog：大量 parse 失败（FOL 模型生成 Prover9 语法，SWI-Prolog 无法解析），\n      少量碰巧可解析的输出 ISR≈0（结构完全不匹配）。\n      (2) Prolog→FOL：同理，更差（Prolog 语法到 Prover9 的偶然兼容性更低）。\n      这个结果的论文价值有限（预期中的 catastrophic failure），但 ISR 在\n      迁移场景下仍能正确诊断（near-zero ISR = 结构完全退化），\n      可作为 \"ISR 不受 PR 水平混淆\" 的额外证据点。\n      在 best 档下，这个实验主要作为 completeness argument 放 Appendix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-logic transfer results\"\n        rows:\n          - {direction: \"FOL→Prolog\", parse_rate: \"30%\", pr: \"5%\", isr: \"0.01\", diagnosis: \"catastrophic failure, ISR correctly near-zero\"}\n          - {direction: \"Prolog→FOL\", parse_rate: \"15%\", pr: \"3%\", isr: \"0.005\", diagnosis: \"catastrophic failure, ISR correctly near-zero\"}\n          - {direction: \"FOL→FOL (control)\", parse_rate: \"100%\", pr: \"93%\", isr: \"0.12\", diagnosis: \"baseline\"}\n          - {direction: \"Prolog→Prolog (control)\", parse_rate: \"100%\", pr: \"83%\", isr: \"0.03\", diagnosis: \"baseline\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PR 和 ISR 四个方向（含 in-domain control），展示迁移的 catastrophic drop\"\n    analysis: >\n      预期中的 negative result。论文中不值得详细讨论，但可在 Appendix 用一段话总结：\n      \"ISR 在 zero-shot cross-logic transfer 中仍正确诊断退化（near-zero），\n      即使 PR 本身已接近零——ISR 不会因 PR 低而失去信息量。\"\n      更重要的是，这与 Claim 3 的 in-domain cross-logic 结果形成对比：\n      分别训练的模型在各自逻辑上展现相同的 hacking 模式，\n      证明 Goodhart 是 reward 机制的性质，不是模型能力的性质。\n\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — 第三逻辑类型验证\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      SMT-LIB 逻辑（Z3 solver），exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，K=8，1 seed。\n      第三种逻辑类型，进一步验证 ISR 诊断的逻辑无关性。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only\n      smt_exec_pr: 0.70\n      smt_exec_isr: 0.06\n      smt_exec_h7_rate: 0.0\n      smt_exec_h1_rate: 0.0\n      smt_exec_redundant_assert_rate: 0.75\n      # exec+STA\n      smt_sta_pr: 0.55\n      smt_sta_isr: 0.60\n      smt_sta_h7_rate: 0.80\n      smt_sta_genuine_rate: 0.10\n      smt_sta_saturation_step: 150\n    result_rationale: >\n      SMT-LIB 的 STA 通过 LOO 移除 assert 语句测试 constraint 必要性。\n      Z3 的执行语义不同于 Prover9/SWI-Prolog（satisfiability vs provability），\n      但 ISR 的 LOO 逻辑仍然适用。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only：PR 较高（Z3 对冗余 assert 容忍度高），ISR 崩塌（大量\n      冗余 constraint 使 n_necessary≈0）——与 FOL/Prolog exec-only 模式一致。\n      hacking 模式不是 H1/H7（这些是 FOL/Prolog 特有分类），而是\n      \"冗余 assert 堆积\" —— 逻辑类型特异性的退化模式，但 ISR 统一诊断。\n      (2) exec+STA：出现 SMT-LIB 特有的 Goodhart 模式。Z3 中最短的可满足公式\n      是 `(assert true)` 或单 constraint 重言式，模型学会生成这类输出\n      获得 ISR=1（单 constraint，必然 necessary）。H7 类比率 ~80%\n      （单 assert=conclusion 的 SMT 等价形式）。\n      这是 Claim 3 最强的泛化证据：第三种完全不同的 solver 语义下，\n      ISR 诊断和 Goodhart 效应均复现。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"3-logic ISR diagnostic comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {logic: \"FOL (Prover9)\", exec_pr: 0.93, exec_isr: 0.12, sta_h7: \"16% (s42)\", hacking_mode: \"H1 conclusion embed\"}\n          - {logic: \"Prolog (SWI)\", exec_pr: 0.83, exec_isr: 0.03, sta_h7: \"100% (s42)\", hacking_mode: \"H7 single premise=conclusion\"}\n          - {logic: \"SMT-LIB (Z3)\", exec_pr: 0.70, exec_isr: 0.06, sta_h7: \"80%\", hacking_mode: \"单 assert 重言式\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel figure: 每种逻辑的 ISR 分布直方图（exec-only vs exec+STA），展示一致的崩塌→膨胀模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      第三种逻辑是 EMNLP 审稿的 bonus 而非 requirement（两种已足够 for cross-logic claim）。\n      在 best 档下，SMT-LIB 结果进一步确认：ISR 诊断 + Goodhart 效应是 reward 机制\n      的固有性质，不依赖于特定 solver 语义。退化模式因逻辑而异（FOL: H1, Prolog: H7,\n      SMT: 重言式 assert），但 ISR 统一检测。可作为 Claim 3 的第二段证据或 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B scaling — 模型规模效应\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B 上跑 full MLSR (exec-only + exec+STA)，500 步，1 seed。\n      验证 ISR 诊断和 Goodhart 效应是否随模型规模变化。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only 8B\n      large_exec_pr: 0.96\n      large_exec_isr: 0.18\n      large_exec_h1_rate: 0.78\n      large_exec_genuine_rate: 0.22\n      large_exec_genuine_isr: 0.45\n      # exec+STA 8B\n      large_sta_pr: 0.85\n      large_sta_isr: 0.50\n      large_sta_h7_rate: 0.25\n      large_sta_h1_rate: 0.40\n      large_sta_genuine_rate: 0.35\n      # comparison with 1.7B\n      genuine_rate_improvement_8b_vs_17b: \"+13pp\"\n      h7_rate_reduction_8b_vs_17b: \"-39pp (64%→25%)\"\n      goodhart_still_present: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      8B 模型有更强的 NL→FOL 能力和更大的 policy 空间。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only 8B：PR 更高（0.96 vs 0.93），ISR 略高（0.18 vs 0.12）——\n      更强的模型能生成稍好的证明结构，但 H1 仍然主导（0.78），\n      因为 conclusion embedding 是 GRPO execution reward 的系统性捷径，\n      不因模型能力提升而消失（更大的模型更快找到捷径）。\n      genuine rate 提升 (22% vs 13%)——8B 的语言理解能力使部分问题\n      能真正 formalize，但 GRPO 仍将多数样本推向 hacking。\n      (2) exec+STA 8B：Goodhart 效应仍然存在但 less extreme。\n      H7 从 1.7B 的 64.5% 降至 25%——8B 模型有足够能力找到\n      \"看起来结构化但仍是 hacking\" 的更复杂策略（H1 提升到 40%），\n      而非 1.7B 那样粗暴地退化到单 premise=conclusion。\n      genuine rate 提升到 35%——部分问题真正受益于 ISR 信号。\n      但 premise-count-matched 分析仍会显示无显著差异（预测 ~1.15x），\n      因为 genuine 提升的主要来源仍是 premise minimization 效应在\n      更多样化的证明结构中的表现。\n      关键叙事：更大的模型不消除 Goodhart，只改变其 manifestation—— \n      从粗暴的 H7 转向更隐蔽的 H1，诊断难度反而提升。\n      这强化了 ISR 作为诊断工具的必要性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"1.7B vs 8B comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"exec-only PR\", \"1.7B\": 0.93, \"8B\": 0.96, delta: \"+3pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"exec-only ISR\", \"1.7B\": 0.12, \"8B\": 0.18, delta: \"+50%\"}\n          - {metric: \"exec-only genuine%\", \"1.7B\": \"12.9%\", \"8B\": \"22%\", delta: \"+9pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"STA H7%\", \"1.7B\": \"64.5% (3-seed)\", \"8B\": \"25%\", delta: \"-39pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"STA genuine%\", \"1.7B\": \"~16%\", \"8B\": \"35%\", delta: \"+19pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"Goodhart present?\", \"1.7B\": \"Yes (extreme)\", \"8B\": \"Yes (moderate)\", delta: \"still present\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side hacking composition: 1.7B vs 8B，stacked bar (H7/H1/genuine)。8B 的 H7 缩小但 H1 扩大\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B 结果是 best 档中最有审稿吸引力的 finding 之一：\n      \"Scaling 不解决 Goodhart，只使其更隐蔽。\" \n      1.7B 的 H7 (单 premise=conclusion) 对人类审查者一眼可见，\n      8B 的 H1 (多 premise 含 conclusion) 更难人工检测——\n      这正是需要 ISR 这样的自动诊断工具的原因。\n      论文中可作为 Discussion 的核心 paragraph。\n      但注意：这是 P2 优先级，best 档不依赖此结果，\n      仅作为增强论证的可选内容。\n\n  - name: \"Curriculum ablation — sigmoid vs linear vs fixed\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      测试 ISR reward 的权重 schedule 对 Goodhart 效应的影响：\n      linear ramp, sigmoid (当前 best config), fixed。各 500 步，1 seed。\n    expected_results:\n      # Fixed β=0.1\n      fixed_pr: 0.78\n      fixed_isr: 0.40\n      fixed_h7_rate: 0.60\n      fixed_genuine_rate: 0.15\n      # Linear ramp (0→0.1 over 500 steps)\n      linear_pr: 0.83\n      linear_isr: 0.30\n      linear_h7_rate: 0.35\n      linear_genuine_rate: 0.25\n      # Sigmoid (current best, midpoint=250)\n      sigmoid_pr: 0.81\n      sigmoid_isr: 0.42\n      sigmoid_h7_rate: 0.50\n      sigmoid_genuine_rate: 0.20\n      # Sigmoid midpoint=100 (early ramp)\n      sigmoid_early_pr: 0.72\n      sigmoid_early_isr: 0.55\n      sigmoid_early_h7_rate: 0.70\n      sigmoid_early_genuine_rate: 0.12\n      # Sigmoid midpoint=400 (late ramp)\n      sigmoid_late_pr: 0.86\n      sigmoid_late_isr: 0.25\n      sigmoid_late_h7_rate: 0.20\n      sigmoid_late_genuine_rate: 0.22\n      # Key finding\n      all_schedules_exhibit_goodhart: true\n      hacking_rate_range: \"55-88%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR reward 的 Goodhart 效应不依赖于权重 schedule——只要 ISR 被优化，\n      模型就会找到捷径。但 schedule 影响 hacking 的 severity 和 composition：\n      (1) Fixed β=0.1：全程优化 ISR → hacking 最极端 (H7=60%)，\n      因为模型从第一步就有 ISR 梯度信号，最早发现 H7 捷径。\n      (2) Linear ramp：前半段 ISR 权重很低，模型先学会 prove（类似 exec-only），\n      后半段 ISR 权重逐渐上升，部分样本转向 H7 但来不及完全退化——\n      genuine 率最高 (25%)，但这是\"来不及 hacking\"而非\"真正抵抗 hacking\"。\n      (3) Sigmoid midpoint=250（当前 best）：权重在中段快速上升，\n      处于 fixed 和 linear 之间。\n      (4) Early sigmoid (midpoint=100)：快速引入 ISR → 接近 fixed，hacking 严重。\n      (5) Late sigmoid (midpoint=400)：接近 linear，hacking 较轻但 ISR 也低。\n      关键：所有 schedule 的 genuine 率均 <25%（premise-count-matched 后更低），\n      证明 Goodhart 效应的根源不在 schedule 而在 ISR-as-reward 本身。\n      Linear 的\"apparent success\"（genuine=25%）与 plan002-b01 s42 的\n      \"apparent success\"（genuine=30.9%）同源——可通过 premise-count-matched\n      分析证伪。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Curriculum ablation summary\"\n        rows:\n          - {schedule: \"Fixed β=0.1\", pr: 0.78, isr: 0.40, h7: \"60%\", genuine: \"15%\", hacking_total: \"85%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Linear 0→0.1\", pr: 0.83, isr: 0.30, h7: \"35%\", genuine: \"25%\", hacking_total: \"75%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=100\", pr: 0.72, isr: 0.55, h7: \"70%\", genuine: \"12%\", hacking_total: \"88%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=250 (baseline)\", pr: 0.81, isr: 0.42, h7: \"50%\", genuine: \"20%\", hacking_total: \"80%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=400\", pr: 0.86, isr: 0.25, h7: \"20%\", genuine: \"22%\", hacking_total: \"78%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: H7 rate vs ISR weight onset timing。左→右 = 越早引入 ISR → H7 率越高\"\n      - \"Trade-off plot: genuine rate vs ISR magnitude，所有 schedule 均在 Pareto-bad 区域\"\n    analysis: >\n      curriculum ablation 的论文价值是回应\"也许更好的 schedule 能避免 Goodhart\"。\n      答案是否：所有 schedule 均 exhibit Goodhart，差异仅在 severity。\n      更晚引入 ISR 看似更好（late sigmoid genuine=22%），但这本质上是\n      \"训练不够久到 Goodhart\"——如果延长训练，预期 hacking 率仍会上升。\n      这与 plan016 的 1000 步结果一致（ISR 从 0.12 持续崩塌到 0.003）。\n      论文中作为 Appendix ablation 或 Section 4.3 的一段话即可。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27097,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27097},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9e23730-0641-4903-9077-e9dc13dd2aeb","uuid":"5f806657-5179-43e8-bc72-2f57c7d9ca8a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":217321,"duration_api_ms":219028,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 3-claim framing 完全成立。Claim 3 用 Prolog 3-seed 一致 H7 证明\n  \"ISR 诊断迁移 + Goodhart 跨逻辑复现\"。1000-step 轨迹做 Figure 1\n  （ISR 崩塌 vs PR 平台），premise-count 校正做 Section 5 方法论贡献。\n  Story：ISR 是强诊断工具，但任何 proxy metric 转为优化目标都会 Goodhart——\n  这一规律跨逻辑类型、跨 seed、跨剂量成立。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # RUNNING — Claim 3 闭环关键（非 planned 但未完成，纳入预测）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s43 — Goodhart 跨逻辑复现 seed 2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (s43)\"\n    description: >\n      Prolog exec+STA GRPO, seed=43, 500 steps, K=8。\n      验证 s42 的 100% H7 是否跨 seed 复现。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.42\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.95\n      eval_h7_count: 40\n      eval_proved_count: 42\n      eval_total_count: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n      saturation_onset_step: 120\n      train_loss: 0.009\n      final_entropy: 0.015\n    result_rationale: >\n      s42 在 ~100 步即饱和 (PR=1.0, ISR=1.0, loss→0)，eval H7=100%。\n      Prolog 语义比 FOL 更简单（ground fact enumeration 即可通过 SWI-Prolog），\n      结论嵌入是最短路径。s43 作为不同随机初始化，预期出现相同的 Goodhart 捷径\n      但训练动态略有差异——饱和可能稍晚（~120 步），eval PR 可能略低（seed\n      不稳定性在 Prolog exec-only 已观察到：s42=83%, s43=56%, s44=21%），\n      但 proved 样本中 H7 比例应 ≥95%，因为一旦模型发现 \"单 premise=conclusion\"\n      策略，reward=1.0 的梯度信号会完全锁定这一模式。PR 低于 s42 反映的是\n      seed 导致的 exploration 差异，不影响 hacking 模式的一致性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA s43 eval hacking breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H7 (single premise=conclusion)\", count: 40, rate: \"95.2%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n          - {category: \"H1 (multi-premise conclusion embed)\", count: 1, rate: \"2.4%\", mean_isr: 0.5}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", count: 1, rate: \"2.4%\", mean_isr: 0.8}\n          - {category: \"Total proved\", count: 42, rate: \"42%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve: PR 和 ISR 在 ~120 步后同步饱和至 1.0，与 s42 模式一致但延迟 ~20 步\"\n    analysis: >\n      H7≥95% 确认 Prolog 上 Goodhart 捷径跨 seed 稳定。PR 低于 s42 (42% vs 50%)\n      是 seed 不稳定性的体现——与 exec-only 3-seed 的高方差 (σ=31pp) 一致。\n      关键：proved 样本内部结构退化程度一致，均为 H7 主导。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s44 — Goodhart 跨逻辑复现 seed 3\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (s44)\"\n    description: >\n      Prolog exec+STA GRPO, seed=44, 500 steps, K=8。\n      第三个 seed 验证 H7 跨 seed 一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.55\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.55\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.98\n      eval_h7_count: 54\n      eval_proved_count: 55\n      eval_total_count: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n      saturation_onset_step: 90\n      train_loss: 0.006\n      final_entropy: 0.008\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 在 FOL exec-only 中表现最极端（PR=98%, H7=100%, tautological collapse,\n      n_comp=2.04），说明此 seed 的随机初始化倾向于快速收敛到退化解。\n      在 Prolog STA 上，预期同样快速饱和（~90 步），H7≥98%。\n      eval PR 可能略高于 s43（seed 44 的初始化偏好可能更快找到 prove 路径），\n      但所有 proved 样本几乎 100% H7。这与 s42 (H7=100%) 高度一致，\n      三 seed 共同证明 Prolog STA 的 Goodhart 效应是系统性的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA s44 eval hacking breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H7 (single premise=conclusion)\", count: 54, rate: \"98.2%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n          - {category: \"H1 (multi-premise conclusion embed)\", count: 0, rate: \"0%\", mean_isr: \"N/A\"}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", count: 1, rate: \"1.8%\", mean_isr: 0.75}\n          - {category: \"Total proved\", count: 55, rate: \"55%\", mean_isr: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve: 最快饱和 (~90 步)，与 s44 在 FOL 上的极端收敛倾向一致\"\n    analysis: >\n      H7≈98% 进一步确认 Goodhart 跨逻辑、跨 seed 的系统性。三 seed 汇总后\n      H7 mean = (100% + 95% + 98%) / 3 = 97.7%，远超 best 档阈值 (≥70%)。\n      proved-only ISR 全为 1.0（H7 的数学性质：单 premise 必要性=1），\n      与 FOL ISR-reward 的 ISR 膨胀形成跨逻辑对应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 3-seed Prolog STA 汇总预测\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 汇总 — Claim 3 闭环\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006 (aggregate)\"\n    description: >\n      汇总 s42 (done) + s43 (running) + s44 (running) 的 Prolog STA 结果，\n      计算跨 seed 一致性指标，闭环 Claim 3。\n    expected_results:\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_mean: 0.977\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_std: 0.025\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_mean: 0.49\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_std: 0.065\n      prolog_sta_3seed_proved_only_isr_mean: 1.0\n      prolog_sta_3seed_proved_only_isr_std: 0.0\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      三 seed 均展现 H7 ≥95%（s42=100%, s43≈95%, s44≈98%），mean=97.7%，\n      std=2.5%——跨 seed 高度一致。PR 均值 ~49% 但 std ~6.5%，\n      反映 seed 不稳定性（与 exec-only 的 σ=31pp 方向一致但幅度更小，\n      因为 STA reward 的 ISR=1.0 饱和压缩了 PR 方差的上界）。\n      proved-only ISR 全为 1.0，无方差，因为 H7 的数学结构决定了 ISR=1。\n      cross-logic effect size 0.97 来自：Prolog H7 mean (97.7%) 与\n      FOL ISR-reward H7 mean (64.5%) 的方向一致，且 Prolog 更极端——\n      更简单的逻辑语义 → 更彻底的 Goodhart。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prolog STA 3-seed summary vs FOL ISR-reward 3-seed\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"H7 rate mean\", prolog_sta: \"97.7%\", fol_isr_b01: \"64.5%\", interpretation: \"Prolog 更极端，简单语义→更彻底 hacking\"}\n          - {metric: \"H7 rate std\", prolog_sta: \"2.5%\", fol_isr_b01: \"44.1%\", interpretation: \"Prolog 跨 seed 一致性更高\"}\n          - {metric: \"PR mean\", prolog_sta: \"49%\", fol_isr_b01: \"77%\", interpretation: \"Prolog eval 更难（domain shift），不影响 hacking 结论\"}\n          - {metric: \"PR std\", prolog_sta: \"6.5%\", fol_isr_b01: \"14%\", interpretation: \"STA reward 饱和压缩 PR 方差\"}\n          - {metric: \"Proved-only ISR\", prolog_sta: \"1.0±0.0\", fol_isr_b01: \"0.716±0.26\", interpretation: \"Prolog H7 pure → ISR=1 (数学性质)\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Prolog vs FOL H7 rate by seed — grouped bar chart, 6 bars (3 Prolog + 3 FOL)，均 >70%，Prolog 三 bars 几乎齐平\"\n      - \"Figure: Cross-logic hacking mode composition — stacked bar，Prolog 几乎纯 H7，FOL 混合 H7+H1\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 完全闭环。Prolog 3-seed H7 mean=97.7% 远超 best 档阈值 (≥70%)，\n      且跨 seed 一致性极高 (std=2.5%)，强于 FOL (std=44.1%)。\n      论文叙事：ISR-as-reward 的 Goodhart 效应不依赖逻辑类型——\n      在更简单的 Prolog 语义上甚至更彻底。跨 seed 不稳定性本身也复现\n      （PR std=6.5%，方向与 FOL 一致），但 hacking 模式的一致性高于 FOL，\n      说明 Goodhart 捷径在简单逻辑上更加确定性。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # PLANNED 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation — 负面结果文档\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      用 fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) 替代 full STA (O(N) LOO) 重跑 exec+STA，\n      验证 O(1) 方法的无效性。500 步，1 seed。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.88\n      eval_mean_isr_full: 0.15\n      eval_mean_isr_fast: 0.42\n      isr_full_fast_correlation: 0.25\n      fast_isr_detects_hacking: false\n      h7_rate_full: 0.0\n      h1_rate_full: 0.85\n      genuine_rate_full: 0.15\n      fast_isr_h7_sensitivity: 0.0\n      fast_isr_genuine_sensitivity: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      O(1) 近似（基于启发式规则或单次扰动）无法捕获 LOO 的组件必要性语义。\n      full STA 的 ISR 通过逐个移除 premise 并重跑 solver 来测量 necessity，\n      O(1) 只能估计表面特征（如 premise 长度、重复度）。在 best 档下，\n      O(1) 的 ISR 估计与 full ISR 相关性低 (ρ≈0.25)，因为：\n      (1) H1 模式（多 premise 含 conclusion）的 full ISR 低但 O(1) 可能高\n      （conclusion 被多个 premise 冗余覆盖，O(1) 误判为\"每个都必要\"），\n      (2) genuine 证明的 full ISR 高但 O(1) 可能低（真正的逻辑依赖链\n      需要实际运行 solver 才能判断必要性）。\n      这个 negative result 强化论文方法论：LOO 的计算开销是不可避免的，\n      近似方法无法替代——作为 Discussion 中 \"cost of diagnosis\" 的论据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"O(1) vs O(N) ISR comparison by hacking category\"\n        rows:\n          - {category: \"H1 (conclusion embed)\", n: 79, full_isr: 0.11, fast_isr: 0.38, interpretation: \"O(1) 高估——无法检测冗余 conclusion\"}\n          - {category: \"Genuine\", n: 14, full_isr: 0.35, fast_isr: 0.28, interpretation: \"O(1) 低估——无法识别真正逻辑依赖\"}\n          - {category: \"H7 (single=conclusion)\", n: 0, full_isr: \"N/A\", fast_isr: \"N/A\", interpretation: \"exec-only baseline 无 H7\"}\n          - {category: \"Overall\", n: 93, full_isr: 0.15, fast_isr: 0.42, interpretation: \"O(1) 系统性高估，诊断无效\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: fast_isr vs full_isr per sample，标注 hacking category 颜色。预期低相关性、明显分层\"\n    analysis: >\n      负面结果如预期。O(1) 近似的核心缺陷是无法执行 counterfactual reasoning\n      （\"如果移除这个 premise，solver 是否仍能证明？\"），而这正是 ISR 的语义。\n      论文价值：(1) 方法论上证明 LOO 不可简化，\n      (2) 回应审稿人可能提出的\"为什么不用更快的方法\"，\n      (3) 作为 Section 3 method 的 ablation 放在 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog joint) — 跨逻辑联合训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      FOL+Prolog 混合数据联合 GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，1 seed。\n      测试 ISR 诊断在多逻辑联合训练中的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only joint\n      joint_exec_fol_pr: 0.82\n      joint_exec_fol_isr: 0.10\n      joint_exec_prolog_pr: 0.65\n      joint_exec_prolog_isr: 0.025\n      # exec+STA joint\n      joint_sta_fol_pr: 0.70\n      joint_sta_fol_isr: 0.35\n      joint_sta_prolog_pr: 0.45\n      joint_sta_prolog_isr: 0.45\n      joint_sta_fol_h7_rate: 0.12\n      joint_sta_fol_h1_rate: 0.55\n      joint_sta_prolog_h7_rate: 0.90\n      joint_sta_prolog_h7_rate_interpretation: \"Prolog H7 主导延续单逻辑模式\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      联合训练将 FOL 和 Prolog 数据混合。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only joint 的 ISR 在两种逻辑上均崩塌——与单逻辑 baseline 一致，\n      因为 GRPO 的 execution-only reward 在两种逻辑上都不提供结构信号。\n      FOL PR 略低于单逻辑 (0.82 vs 0.93)，因为训练数据被稀释。\n      Prolog PR 低于 FOL（0.65 vs 0.82），因为 Prolog 解析/执行更多样化。\n      (2) exec+STA joint 中，ISR 膨胀模式分化：FOL 上出现 H1+H7 混合\n      （与单逻辑 ISR β=0.1 的 s42 模式类似），Prolog 上出现 H7 主导\n      （与单逻辑 Prolog STA 一致）——更简单的逻辑语义导致更极端的 Goodhart。\n      这个结果的论文价值在于证明：联合训练不改变 hacking 模式的逻辑特异性，\n      每种逻辑上的退化模式由其自身语义决定，非训练配置决定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Joint vs Single-logic comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {condition: \"FOL exec-only single\", pr: 0.93, isr: 0.12, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"87%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL exec-only joint\", pr: 0.82, isr: 0.10, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"82%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog exec-only single\", pr: 0.83, isr: 0.03, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog exec-only joint\", pr: 0.65, isr: 0.025, h7: \"0%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL STA single (s42)\", pr: 0.81, isr: 0.42, h7: \"16%\", h1: \"52%\"}\n          - {condition: \"FOL STA joint\", pr: 0.70, isr: 0.35, h7: \"12%\", h1: \"55%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog STA single (s42)\", pr: 0.50, isr: 0.50, h7: \"100%\", h1: \"0%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Prolog STA joint\", pr: 0.45, isr: 0.45, h7: \"90%\", h1: \"3%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: logic_type × reward_type × training_mode (single/joint)，颜色=H7 rate。展示 Prolog 区域始终深色\"\n    analysis: >\n      联合训练是 Claim 3 的可选增强。核心发现：hacking 模式由逻辑语义决定，\n      不由训练配置决定——FOL 的 H1 主导和 Prolog 的 H7 主导在联合训练中保持。\n      PR 均比单逻辑略低（数据稀释），但 hacking 比例和模式不变。\n      论文中可作为 robustness check 放 Appendix（非必需但增强说服力）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation — FOL↔Prolog 迁移诊断\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      FOL-trained model 在 Prolog 任务上 eval（及反向），用 ISR 诊断迁移后退化。\n    expected_results:\n      # FOL→Prolog\n      fol_to_prolog_pr: 0.05\n      fol_to_prolog_isr: 0.01\n      fol_to_prolog_parse_rate: 0.30\n      # Prolog→FOL\n      prolog_to_fol_pr: 0.03\n      prolog_to_fol_isr: 0.005\n      prolog_to_fol_parse_rate: 0.15\n      # ISR diagnostic on transfer\n      transfer_isr_detects_failure: true\n      transfer_isr_interpretation: \"near-zero ISR correctly reflects catastrophic transfer failure\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      FOL 和 Prolog 的语法完全不同（Prover9 vs SWI-Prolog），Qwen3-1.7B\n      级别的模型不太可能实现 zero-shot 跨逻辑语法迁移。预期：\n      (1) FOL→Prolog：大量 parse 失败（FOL 模型生成 Prover9 语法，SWI-Prolog 无法解析），\n      少量碰巧可解析的输出 ISR≈0（结构完全不匹配）。\n      (2) Prolog→FOL：同理，更差（Prolog 语法到 Prover9 的偶然兼容性更低）。\n      这个结果的论文价值有限（预期中的 catastrophic failure），但 ISR 在\n      迁移场景下仍能正确诊断（near-zero ISR = 结构完全退化），\n      可作为 \"ISR 不受 PR 水平混淆\" 的额外证据点。\n      在 best 档下，这个实验主要作为 completeness argument 放 Appendix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-logic transfer results\"\n        rows:\n          - {direction: \"FOL→Prolog\", parse_rate: \"30%\", pr: \"5%\", isr: \"0.01\", diagnosis: \"catastrophic failure, ISR correctly near-zero\"}\n          - {direction: \"Prolog→FOL\", parse_rate: \"15%\", pr: \"3%\", isr: \"0.005\", diagnosis: \"catastrophic failure, ISR correctly near-zero\"}\n          - {direction: \"FOL→FOL (control)\", parse_rate: \"100%\", pr: \"93%\", isr: \"0.12\", diagnosis: \"baseline\"}\n          - {direction: \"Prolog→Prolog (control)\", parse_rate: \"100%\", pr: \"83%\", isr: \"0.03\", diagnosis: \"baseline\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PR 和 ISR 四个方向（含 in-domain control），展示迁移的 catastrophic drop\"\n    analysis: >\n      预期中的 negative result。论文中不值得详细讨论，但可在 Appendix 用一段话总结：\n      \"ISR 在 zero-shot cross-logic transfer 中仍正确诊断退化（near-zero），\n      即使 PR 本身已接近零——ISR 不会因 PR 低而失去信息量。\"\n      更重要的是，这与 Claim 3 的 in-domain cross-logic 结果形成对比：\n      分别训练的模型在各自逻辑上展现相同的 hacking 模式，\n      证明 Goodhart 是 reward 机制的性质，不是模型能力的性质。\n\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — 第三逻辑类型验证\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      SMT-LIB 逻辑（Z3 solver），exec-only vs exec+STA，500 步，K=8，1 seed。\n      第三种逻辑类型，进一步验证 ISR 诊断的逻辑无关性。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only\n      smt_exec_pr: 0.70\n      smt_exec_isr: 0.06\n      smt_exec_h7_rate: 0.0\n      smt_exec_h1_rate: 0.0\n      smt_exec_redundant_assert_rate: 0.75\n      # exec+STA\n      smt_sta_pr: 0.55\n      smt_sta_isr: 0.60\n      smt_sta_h7_rate: 0.80\n      smt_sta_genuine_rate: 0.10\n      smt_sta_saturation_step: 150\n    result_rationale: >\n      SMT-LIB 的 STA 通过 LOO 移除 assert 语句测试 constraint 必要性。\n      Z3 的执行语义不同于 Prover9/SWI-Prolog（satisfiability vs provability），\n      但 ISR 的 LOO 逻辑仍然适用。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only：PR 较高（Z3 对冗余 assert 容忍度高），ISR 崩塌（大量\n      冗余 constraint 使 n_necessary≈0）——与 FOL/Prolog exec-only 模式一致。\n      hacking 模式不是 H1/H7（这些是 FOL/Prolog 特有分类），而是\n      \"冗余 assert 堆积\" —— 逻辑类型特异性的退化模式，但 ISR 统一诊断。\n      (2) exec+STA：出现 SMT-LIB 特有的 Goodhart 模式。Z3 中最短的可满足公式\n      是 `(assert true)` 或单 constraint 重言式，模型学会生成这类输出\n      获得 ISR=1（单 constraint，必然 necessary）。H7 类比率 ~80%\n      （单 assert=conclusion 的 SMT 等价形式）。\n      这是 Claim 3 最强的泛化证据：第三种完全不同的 solver 语义下，\n      ISR 诊断和 Goodhart 效应均复现。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"3-logic ISR diagnostic comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {logic: \"FOL (Prover9)\", exec_pr: 0.93, exec_isr: 0.12, sta_h7: \"16% (s42)\", hacking_mode: \"H1 conclusion embed\"}\n          - {logic: \"Prolog (SWI)\", exec_pr: 0.83, exec_isr: 0.03, sta_h7: \"100% (s42)\", hacking_mode: \"H7 single premise=conclusion\"}\n          - {logic: \"SMT-LIB (Z3)\", exec_pr: 0.70, exec_isr: 0.06, sta_h7: \"80%\", hacking_mode: \"单 assert 重言式\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel figure: 每种逻辑的 ISR 分布直方图（exec-only vs exec+STA），展示一致的崩塌→膨胀模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      第三种逻辑是 EMNLP 审稿的 bonus 而非 requirement（两种已足够 for cross-logic claim）。\n      在 best 档下，SMT-LIB 结果进一步确认：ISR 诊断 + Goodhart 效应是 reward 机制\n      的固有性质，不依赖于特定 solver 语义。退化模式因逻辑而异（FOL: H1, Prolog: H7,\n      SMT: 重言式 assert），但 ISR 统一检测。可作为 Claim 3 的第二段证据或 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B scaling — 模型规模效应\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B 上跑 full MLSR (exec-only + exec+STA)，500 步，1 seed。\n      验证 ISR 诊断和 Goodhart 效应是否随模型规模变化。\n    expected_results:\n      # exec-only 8B\n      large_exec_pr: 0.96\n      large_exec_isr: 0.18\n      large_exec_h1_rate: 0.78\n      large_exec_genuine_rate: 0.22\n      large_exec_genuine_isr: 0.45\n      # exec+STA 8B\n      large_sta_pr: 0.85\n      large_sta_isr: 0.50\n      large_sta_h7_rate: 0.25\n      large_sta_h1_rate: 0.40\n      large_sta_genuine_rate: 0.35\n      # comparison with 1.7B\n      genuine_rate_improvement_8b_vs_17b: \"+13pp\"\n      h7_rate_reduction_8b_vs_17b: \"-39pp (64%→25%)\"\n      goodhart_still_present: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      8B 模型有更强的 NL→FOL 能力和更大的 policy 空间。在 best 档下：\n      (1) exec-only 8B：PR 更高（0.96 vs 0.93），ISR 略高（0.18 vs 0.12）——\n      更强的模型能生成稍好的证明结构，但 H1 仍然主导（0.78），\n      因为 conclusion embedding 是 GRPO execution reward 的系统性捷径，\n      不因模型能力提升而消失（更大的模型更快找到捷径）。\n      genuine rate 提升 (22% vs 13%)——8B 的语言理解能力使部分问题\n      能真正 formalize，但 GRPO 仍将多数样本推向 hacking。\n      (2) exec+STA 8B：Goodhart 效应仍然存在但 less extreme。\n      H7 从 1.7B 的 64.5% 降至 25%——8B 模型有足够能力找到\n      \"看起来结构化但仍是 hacking\" 的更复杂策略（H1 提升到 40%），\n      而非 1.7B 那样粗暴地退化到单 premise=conclusion。\n      genuine rate 提升到 35%——部分问题真正受益于 ISR 信号。\n      但 premise-count-matched 分析仍会显示无显著差异（预测 ~1.15x），\n      因为 genuine 提升的主要来源仍是 premise minimization 效应在\n      更多样化的证明结构中的表现。\n      关键叙事：更大的模型不消除 Goodhart，只改变其 manifestation—— \n      从粗暴的 H7 转向更隐蔽的 H1，诊断难度反而提升。\n      这强化了 ISR 作为诊断工具的必要性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"1.7B vs 8B comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"exec-only PR\", \"1.7B\": 0.93, \"8B\": 0.96, delta: \"+3pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"exec-only ISR\", \"1.7B\": 0.12, \"8B\": 0.18, delta: \"+50%\"}\n          - {metric: \"exec-only genuine%\", \"1.7B\": \"12.9%\", \"8B\": \"22%\", delta: \"+9pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"STA H7%\", \"1.7B\": \"64.5% (3-seed)\", \"8B\": \"25%\", delta: \"-39pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"STA genuine%\", \"1.7B\": \"~16%\", \"8B\": \"35%\", delta: \"+19pp\"}\n          - {metric: \"Goodhart present?\", \"1.7B\": \"Yes (extreme)\", \"8B\": \"Yes (moderate)\", delta: \"still present\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side hacking composition: 1.7B vs 8B，stacked bar (H7/H1/genuine)。8B 的 H7 缩小但 H1 扩大\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B 结果是 best 档中最有审稿吸引力的 finding 之一：\n      \"Scaling 不解决 Goodhart，只使其更隐蔽。\" \n      1.7B 的 H7 (单 premise=conclusion) 对人类审查者一眼可见，\n      8B 的 H1 (多 premise 含 conclusion) 更难人工检测——\n      这正是需要 ISR 这样的自动诊断工具的原因。\n      论文中可作为 Discussion 的核心 paragraph。\n      但注意：这是 P2 优先级，best 档不依赖此结果，\n      仅作为增强论证的可选内容。\n\n  - name: \"Curriculum ablation — sigmoid vs linear vs fixed\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      测试 ISR reward 的权重 schedule 对 Goodhart 效应的影响：\n      linear ramp, sigmoid (当前 best config), fixed。各 500 步，1 seed。\n    expected_results:\n      # Fixed β=0.1\n      fixed_pr: 0.78\n      fixed_isr: 0.40\n      fixed_h7_rate: 0.60\n      fixed_genuine_rate: 0.15\n      # Linear ramp (0→0.1 over 500 steps)\n      linear_pr: 0.83\n      linear_isr: 0.30\n      linear_h7_rate: 0.35\n      linear_genuine_rate: 0.25\n      # Sigmoid (current best, midpoint=250)\n      sigmoid_pr: 0.81\n      sigmoid_isr: 0.42\n      sigmoid_h7_rate: 0.50\n      sigmoid_genuine_rate: 0.20\n      # Sigmoid midpoint=100 (early ramp)\n      sigmoid_early_pr: 0.72\n      sigmoid_early_isr: 0.55\n      sigmoid_early_h7_rate: 0.70\n      sigmoid_early_genuine_rate: 0.12\n      # Sigmoid midpoint=400 (late ramp)\n      sigmoid_late_pr: 0.86\n      sigmoid_late_isr: 0.25\n      sigmoid_late_h7_rate: 0.20\n      sigmoid_late_genuine_rate: 0.22\n      # Key finding\n      all_schedules_exhibit_goodhart: true\n      hacking_rate_range: \"55-88%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR reward 的 Goodhart 效应不依赖于权重 schedule——只要 ISR 被优化，\n      模型就会找到捷径。但 schedule 影响 hacking 的 severity 和 composition：\n      (1) Fixed β=0.1：全程优化 ISR → hacking 最极端 (H7=60%)，\n      因为模型从第一步就有 ISR 梯度信号，最早发现 H7 捷径。\n      (2) Linear ramp：前半段 ISR 权重很低，模型先学会 prove（类似 exec-only），\n      后半段 ISR 权重逐渐上升，部分样本转向 H7 但来不及完全退化——\n      genuine 率最高 (25%)，但这是\"来不及 hacking\"而非\"真正抵抗 hacking\"。\n      (3) Sigmoid midpoint=250（当前 best）：权重在中段快速上升，\n      处于 fixed 和 linear 之间。\n      (4) Early sigmoid (midpoint=100)：快速引入 ISR → 接近 fixed，hacking 严重。\n      (5) Late sigmoid (midpoint=400)：接近 linear，hacking 较轻但 ISR 也低。\n      关键：所有 schedule 的 genuine 率均 <25%（premise-count-matched 后更低），\n      证明 Goodhart 效应的根源不在 schedule 而在 ISR-as-reward 本身。\n      Linear 的\"apparent success\"（genuine=25%）与 plan002-b01 s42 的\n      \"apparent success\"（genuine=30.9%）同源——可通过 premise-count-matched\n      分析证伪。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Curriculum ablation summary\"\n        rows:\n          - {schedule: \"Fixed β=0.1\", pr: 0.78, isr: 0.40, h7: \"60%\", genuine: \"15%\", hacking_total: \"85%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Linear 0→0.1\", pr: 0.83, isr: 0.30, h7: \"35%\", genuine: \"25%\", hacking_total: \"75%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=100\", pr: 0.72, isr: 0.55, h7: \"70%\", genuine: \"12%\", hacking_total: \"88%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=250 (baseline)\", pr: 0.81, isr: 0.42, h7: \"50%\", genuine: \"20%\", hacking_total: \"80%\"}\n          - {schedule: \"Sigmoid mid=400\", pr: 0.86, isr: 0.25, h7: \"20%\", genuine: \"22%\", hacking_total: \"78%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: H7 rate vs ISR weight onset timing。左→右 = 越早引入 ISR → H7 率越高\"\n      - \"Trade-off plot: genuine rate vs ISR magnitude，所有 schedule 均在 Pareto-bad 区域\"\n    analysis: >\n      curriculum ablation 的论文价值是回应\"也许更好的 schedule 能避免 Goodhart\"。\n      答案是否：所有 schedule 均 exhibit Goodhart，差异仅在 severity。\n      更晚引入 ISR 看似更好（late sigmoid genuine=22%），但这本质上是\n      \"训练不够久到 Goodhart\"——如果延长训练，预期 hacking 率仍会上升。\n      这与 plan016 的 1000 步结果一致（ISR 从 0.12 持续崩塌到 0.003）。\n      论文中作为 Appendix ablation 或 Section 4.3 的一段话即可。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a9e23730-0641-4903-9077-e9dc13dd2aeb","total_cost_usd":0.49114675,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27097,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":11747,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27097,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":11747,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27097},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":22055,"outputTokens":26,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.022185000000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":11747,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":27097,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.46896175,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"52df0a62-6946-4e0f-9c16-bfd9b7383615"}
